language|English

book|BackDoorLocked|ordered|nokeep|loop
	debug

# for quotas only, follow these rules:
#    Show TOC text with page's button (include action icon in usual way)
#    if {action}, show screen with quotas
#      buttons on this screen follow Pass and Fail
#
# if there's pass/fail but no quota:
#    show TOC text with page's button (include action icon in usual way)
#    if {action}, show new screen with page text and [pass]/[fail] buttons

page|Turn knob|You try to turn the knob. Test {strength} or {agility}.
	quota|20
	pass|@backdoorLockedPass
	fail|@backdoorLockedFail
	toc|The door looks larger and more solid from in here. <i>Maybe it's unlocked?</i> you wonder to yourself.
	

end|Well, you try to put the key into the lock but it doesn't fit, no matter how hard you try. You look at the key and try again. And again. And again. Dejected and out of ideas, you turn away from the door. "I guess we'll have to find another way out," you say to no one in particular.
